<title>USA: Concurrent Computer names Handel chairman.</title>
<headline>Concurrent Computer names Handel chairman.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Concurrent Computer Corp said on Monday it elected Morton Handel the new chairman of the board, replacing John Stihl, who resigned as chairman in September.</p>
<p>Handel has been a member of Concurrent's board of directors since June 1991.  He is currently president of S&amp;H Consulting Ltd, a private investment and consulting company.</p>
<p>E. Courtney Siegel remains president and chief executive of Concurrent, the company said.</p>
</text>
